1704996.steps:
step 1: go to Network page, open configuration Window for primary WAN, select IP Assignment as PPPoE, fill in user name and password as appropriate, accept default settings for all other options, and click OK;
step 2: sniffer from the network or use CDRouter script to verify that SonicWALL PADI should have the following information set properly:
a) DESTINATION_ADDR set to the broadcast address;
b) CODE field is set to 0x09;
c) SESSION_ID is set to 0x0000;
d) the packet contains exactly one TAG of TAG_TYPE Service-Name;
e) the entire PADI packet must not exceed 1484 octets;
f) ETHER_TYPE is 0x8863;
g) the packet contains on TAG of TAG_TYPE Host-Uniq, which should have SonicWALL MAC address as its data

